error[SC0333]: this expression is borrowed for longer than this expression exists
  --> tests/ui/regions/iterator_outlives_its_string.science:14:15
   |
14 |     let it be "x\ny".lines()
   |               -------------- this expression is borrowed here
   |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ ...and the borrow is still needed here, after the value is gone
   |               -------------- this expression is declared here
   |
   = note: a borrow may not outlive what it points at (§6.1 rule 5); the value's storage ends at the close of the scope it was declared in
   = note: there is no lifetime syntax to widen: the fix is to return an owned value or an index, which is what `examples/21_compiler_shapes.science` §1 does

